WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.150
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:09.690
Dr. Bright is not, nor has he ever been, the&nbsp;
"Undisputed SCP Intercontinental Champion".

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:14.970
Dr. Bright has never won a competitive sporting&nbsp;
event in his life, from racketball to boxing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:20.730
This is no exception. We're not entirely sure&nbsp;
what would even constitute an SCP Champion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:27.030
but if there was one? It wouldn’t be Dr. Bright.
Oh, cheer up buddy. Don't cry. You can still have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.024
a trophy if you want. Just&nbsp;
for participation, though.

